NNAAMMEE
     bbhhnndd__cchhiippcc — Broadcom Home Networking Division ChipCommon Driver

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     To compile this driver into the kernel, add this line to the kernel con‐
     figuration file:

           ddeevviiccee bbhhnndd

     To compile driver support for all additional devices found in embedded
     systems, add the following additional lines to the kernel configuration
     file:

           ddeevviiccee ccffii
           ddeevviiccee ggppiioo
           ddeevviiccee ssppiibbuuss
           ddeevviiccee uuaarrtt

     To load the driver as a module at boot, add this line to loader.conf(5):

           bhnd_load="YES"

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The bbhhnndd__cchhiippcc driver supports the ChipCommon core found in Broadcom Home
     Networking Division network chipsets and embedded systems.

     The ChipCommon core provides an interface to common hardware facilities,
     including device identification, UARTs, CFI and SPI flash, One-time Pro‐
     grammable (OTP) Memory, and GPIO.

